5280177_1012617213990979_1732549949916101256_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J-i1duKP0M4Q7kNvwHqd4ZV&_nc_oc=Adr3gcU1LtsSZ2GqAYLTPm4KsKfrUFi2u1DSMkC7Up3blnLKbgSgad3s8grEUMNvQJM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0SAel0ChL33gOtbVDDE7airIhmeD9M3TyHMGvola-m5Q&oe=69D66478"}, {"file_name": "image4.png", "id": "1151089155995496", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974848_1151089159328829_2039739925044486928_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gjce7g8Rs6oQ7kNvwG-A4uk&_nc_oc=AdqY3_bROjhRo46EHJo4zZ1Ea_WBrSWY6iGWu1lSyt4Dy0Ux_bAd_t2WTXwdioCfT5g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2oUY51-e5uoZDXtnf-9Ku9fRYt3I7jsPiyxpExrrF7yQ&oe=69D65D6F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Keyart_2560x1440.png", "id": "1984373528679847", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974591_1984373532013180_122028893976097645_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=osEi5jFolfoQ7kNvwFKhy--&_nc_oc=Adpp8cTZSuKTYw4FibFTs_f0Iy54t7Gf3N7ClQArM7D9V5tROJ2OzzjNU80oxLDt-8o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1uul3Y07pTbpwbuyIT4HJZROiBRA7vmu1J-bcSOGuufQ&oe=69D6383B"}, "display_name": "My Monsters - Demo", "keywords": ["Third", "Action", "Adventure", "Indie", "Fanstasy"], "long_description": "My Monsters is an action-adventure VR game that with a *100% hand-painted art*, creating a visually stunning *world full of fantasy and surrealism*. At the heart of the game is a deep narrative that explores humanity's greatest inner struggles\u2014anxiety, fear, and loneliness. As a player, you are transported to Onirium, a *dream-like realm* where you meet Moti, a frightened little monster with no memory.\n\nIn My Monsters, you\u2019re never alone. *Team up with your inner monster*, Moti, to face a variety of enemies, solve intricate puzzles, and overcome challenges in a shared journey. This partnership mechanic fosters a powerful connection with Moti, requiring empathy and courage to navigate obstacles and reveal fragments of a *meaningful dreamlike tale*. Every stage introduces new aspects of this bond, allowing players to experience moments of self-discovery and emotional depth.\n\nKey Features on Demo:\n\n\n\u2694\ufe0f  Combat Enemies: Engage in dynamic battles with your enemies.\n\n\ud83e\udde9  Solve Puzzles: Test your critical thinking and problem-solving skills.\n\n\ud83c\udf19  A Dream-like Tale: Uncover a touching, emotional narrative that delves into themes of self-reflection and growth. \n\n\ud83c\udfa8  100% Hand-Painted Art: Every visual element in the game is carefully crafted by hand, creating a beautiful, one-of-a-kind experience. \n\n\ud83e\udd1d  Team Up with Your Inner Monster: Build a meaningful relationship with Moti, using teamwork, empathy, and courage to overcome every challenge.\n\n*THE GAME IS CURRENTLY IN DEVELOPMENT, AND ITS CONTENT MAY CHANGE.*", "short_description": "My Monsters is a VR action-adventure game featuring stunning 100% hand-painted art. In this demo, you\u2019ll explore Onirium, a dream-like world filled with emotional depth, as you face humanity's greatest inner monsters like anxiety and fear. Meet Moti, a scared little monster with no memory, and team up to battle enemies, solve puzzles, and overcome challenges. Unravel fragments of a dreamlike narrative as you journey together. The game is currently in development, and its content may change."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mymonsters.ludact.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ludact", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mymonsters.ludact.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "3